<title>INDIA: India RBI holds 91-day t-bill auction on Thursday.</title>
<headline>India RBI holds 91-day t-bill auction on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Tuesday it will hold an auction of 91-day treasury bills for 1.0 billion rupees on Thursday. Payment by successful bidders will be on Saturday, it added.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
